vFM Player - Legacy diagnostics

SD folder: /vFM/tests/legacy

Reserved for optional older test fixtures imported from .vfm-tests-r55. The public package does not include your personal or commercial music collection. No download is needed for ordinary playback.

Files and instructions:
https://github.com/PanykSystem/vFMPlayer/tree/main/sdcard/tests/legacy

On a PC, use GitHub Code > Download ZIP, then copy the contents of sdcard into /vFM. Keep existing personal settings and recordings.
